<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - RJR Nabisco raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - RJR Nabisco raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer analyst Roy Burry raised the rating of RJR Nabisco Holdings Corp to a buy rating from a hold.</p>
<p>-- Burry said he gave the stock a $35 price target if there is no spinoff of its food unit Nabisco Holdings Corp and $40-plus if there is a spinoff.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1-1/8 to 29-1/4.</p>
</text>
